: POOL) ANNOUNCED TODAY THAT IT HAS PUBLISHED ITS 2022 CORPORATE RESPONSIBILITY REPORT.'}{'symbol': 'RF', 'date': '2023-06-09 09:00:00', 'title': 'REGIONS FINANCIAL CORP. ANNOUNCES UPDATED REFERENCE RATE FOR CERTAIN PREFERRED STOCK', 'text': 'BIRMINGHAM, ALA.--(BUSINESS WIRE)--REGIONS FINANCIAL CORPORATION ON FRIDAY ANNOUNCED AN UPCOMING CHANGE TO THE REFERENCE RATE FOR CERTAIN PREFERRED STOCK.'}{'symbol': 'TFC', 'date': '2023-06-09 13:08:00', 'title': 'TRUIST FOUNDATION GRANTS LIFT $500,000 TO EXPAND ITS SERVICES TO RICHMOND TO SUPPORT UNDERSERVED FAMILIES', 'text': "LIFT WILL PARTNER WITH RICHMOND'S OFFICE OF COMMUNITY WEALTH BUILDING TO CREATE ONE-ON-ONE COACHING MODEL TO SUPPORT SELF-SUFFICIENCY FOR FAMILIES WITHIN COMMUNITY RICHMOND, VA. , JUNE 9, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- TRUIST FOUNDATION\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED A $500,000 GRANT TO LIFT, A NONPROFIT ORGANIZATION DEDICATED TO ADVANCING ECONOMIC EQUITY BY IMPLEMENTING HOLISTIC, HUMAN-FOCUSED SOCIAL SERVICE SYSTEMS WITHIN MARGINALIZED COMMUNITIES."}{'symbol': 'VRTX', 'date': '2023-06-09 11:00:00', 'title': 'VERTEX PRESENTS DATA DEMONSTRATING SIGNIFICANT BENEFITS OF LONG-TERM TREATMENT WITH CFTR MODULATORS AT THE EUROPEAN CYSTIC FIBROSIS CONFERENCE', 'text': "BOSTON--(BUSINESS WIRE)--VERTEX PHARMACEUTICALS INCORPORATED (NASDAQ: VRTX) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT 12 SCIENTIFIC ABSTRACTS ON THE COMPANY'S PORTFOLIO OF CYSTIC FIBROSIS (CF) MEDICINES WERE PRESENTED AT THIS YEAR'S EUROPEAN CYSTIC FIBROSIS SOCIETY'S (ECFS) 46TH EUROPEAN CYSTIC FIBROSIS CONFERENCE HELD JUNE 7-10, 2023, IN VIENNA, AUSTRIA. TOGETHER, THE DATA PRESENTED SHOW THE LONG-TERM BENEFITS OF TREATMENT WITH CFTR MODULATORS AS WELL AS THE IMPORTANCE OF TREATING THE UNDERLYING CAUSE OF CF AS EAR."}{'symbol': 'VRTX', 'date': '2023-06-09 03:01:00', 'title': 'POSITIVE RESULTS FROM PIVOTAL TRIALS OF EXA-CEL FOR TRANSFUSION-DEPENDENT BETA THALASSEMIA AND SEVERE SICKLE CELL DISEASE PRESENTED AT THE 2023 ANNUAL EUROPEAN HEMATOLOGY ASSOCIATION (EHA) CONGRESS', 'text': 'BOSTON 